WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.363
TritonAI Harness is UC San Diego's agent workspace.

2
00:00:03.383 --> 00:00:05.117
It doesn't just answer questions.

3
00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:10.523
It does the work, on your files, with you in control.

4
00:00:11.373 --> 00:00:12.752
Here it is, live.

5
00:00:13.277 --> 00:00:16.378
I ask it to summarize a workshop survey.

6
00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:17.338
In Supervised mode,

7
00:00:17.358 --> 00:00:19.303
it stops and asks before it runs

8
00:00:19.323 --> 00:00:21.641
a command or writes a file.

9
00:00:22.491 --> 00:00:27.443
About a minute later, it's done: the averages, the top comments,

10
00:00:27.552 --> 00:00:31.446
and the four missing ratings, saved to summary.md.

11
00:00:32.296 --> 00:00:34.174
It can also work in desktop apps.

12
00:00:34.397 --> 00:00:35.935
It made this chart in Excel,

13
00:00:35.955 --> 00:00:37.700
using the menus the way you would.

14
00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:39.636
Same project, another output.

15
00:00:39.707 --> 00:00:44.271
It reads the meeting notes and the UC San Diego template,

16
00:00:44.492 --> 00:00:45.712
then builds the deck.

17
00:00:46.562 --> 00:00:49.883
Ninety seconds later: seven slides on the official template,

18
00:00:49.948 --> 00:00:51.990
and every line comes from the notes.

19
00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:58.112
Plugins connect it to campus systems: GitHub, Google Workspace, Kuali Build,

20
00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.100
Microsoft 365, and n8n.

21
00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:03.182
Each ability has its own switch.

22
00:01:04.032 --> 00:01:08.239
Here the n8n plugin finds a workflow, explains each step,

23
00:01:08.329 --> 00:01:11.629
and confirms its last run succeeded, without changing anything.

24
00:01:14.079 --> 00:01:17.543
With GitHub, it reviews a pull request: what changed,

25
00:01:17.598 --> 00:01:20.450
which files it touched, and whether the checks passed.

26
00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:26.872
When a plugin wants to write, like saving an Outlook draft,

27
00:01:27.135 --> 00:01:30.211
Supervised mode stops and asks you first.

28
00:01:31.061 --> 00:01:34.339
Google Workspace and Kuali Build work the same way.

29
00:01:34.879 --> 00:01:37.616
Every write ability is a switch you control.

30
00:01:38.466 --> 00:01:42.136
You can also build small web apps in the campus style,

31
00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:44.182
and try them right in the Harness.

32
00:01:45.032 --> 00:01:50.965
That's TritonAI Harness: real work, on your files, with you in control.
